Chapter: DerivingOrd
  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Codex chapter General

 `deriving Ord` generates lexicographic structural compare returning
 -1/0/1: constructors order by declaration; fields compare in order.

Section: Types

  Color = | Red | Green | Blue  deriving Ord

  Wrap = | Wrap (Integer)  deriving Ord

  Point = record { x : Integer, y : Integer }  deriving Ord

Section: Opening

  opening : [Console] Nothing = act
    print-line-uni (show (compare Red Blue))
    print-line-uni (show (compare Blue Red))
    print-line-uni (show (compare Green Green))
    print-line-uni (show (compare (Wrap 3) (Wrap 5)))
    print-line-uni (show (compare (Wrap 5) (Wrap 5)))
    print-line-uni (show (compare (Point { x = 1, y = 2 }) (Point { x = 1, y = 9 })))
    print-line-uni (show (compare (Point { x = 2, y = 0 }) (Point { x = 1, y = 9 })))
  end

